    "notes": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">NOME COMPLETO: <strong>LI QIANG</strong></p>\n<p>TRABALHO: SUPERVISOR</p>\n<p>IDADE: 47</p>\n<p>PERSONALIDADE: AMBICIOSO</p>\n<p>Qiang &eacute; o supervisor respons&aacute;vel pela esta&ccedil;&atilde;o Matvey.</p>\n<p>Ele &eacute; implac&aacute;vel e ambicioso, e n&atilde;o se importou em receber um suborno para olhar para o outro lado quando os recursos da esta&ccedil;&atilde;o eram desviados para ganho corrupto e para o gen Volkoff.</p>\n<p>Ele ficou surpreso quando seus superiores disseram que ele deveria ir para a esta&ccedil;&atilde;o enquanto um investigador era enviado para encontrar o camarada desaparecido, e garantir que ela n&atilde;o encontre ou haja contra os sinais de corrup&ccedil;&atilde;o.</p>\n<p>Ele far&aacute; o que eles pediram por enquanto por medo de ir preso, mas ele &eacute; leal apenas a si mesmo, todo mundo que se dane.<br><strong>Li Qiang</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Occupation:</strong> Supervisor<br><strong>Age:</strong> 47<br><strong>Personality:</strong> Ambitious</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>ATTRIBUTES</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>STRENGTH:</strong> 4<br><strong>AGILITY:</strong> 3<br><strong>WITS:</strong> 3<br><strong>EMPATHY:</strong> 4</p>\n<p><strong>HEALTH:</strong> 4</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>SKILLS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Heavy Machinery:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Comtech:</strong> 2</li>\n<li><strong>Manipulation:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Command:</strong> 2</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>TALENTS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Influence</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Buddy:</strong> None<br><strong>Rival:</strong> Everyone</p>\n<p><strong>Signature Item:</strong> Demerits Book</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>EQUIPMENT</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UPP 9mm Service Pistol</strong> (1 load)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Backstory</strong></h3>\n<p>Li Qiang is the no-nonsense supervisor of <strong>Matvey Station</strong>. Ruthlessly ambitious, he turned a blind eye to resource diversion and corruption when bribed, funneling profits to the notorious <strong>General Volkoff</strong>.</p>\n<p>Qiang's confidence was shaken when his superiors unexpectedly ordered him to go to the station with an investigator that was dispatched to locate a missing comrade. His covert mission is to ensure that no evidence of corruption surfaces and to obstruct any inquiries that might implicate him or Volkoff.</p>\n<p>Though he begrudgingly complies with the directives to avoid imprisonment, Qiang is loyal only to himself. Everyone else, in his view, is expendable.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
